罰されます"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["4つの門はすべて閉ざされています。家族に内緒で死亡を条件とした保険をかけることは、契約が無効となります。保険契約者が被保険者の死亡を故意に…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/08-39"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["警察への通報時はその場で受理票を受け取ること、不立案（事件化しない）の場合は書面での通知が必要：7 日以内に再審査を申請でき、さらに 7 日以内に再審査請求が可能。検察庁は警察に立案を通知できます"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["通報した際は、その場で受理票を受け取ってください。これは通報した唯一の証拠となります。警察が立案しない（事件化しない）と決定した場合、書面…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/08"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：自分を犠牲にしないために：法律と財産の安全を守る"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"ro